# Optional. Enables real bet365 (and other UK/EU sportsbook) odds on the
# Soccer tab via The Odds API (the-odds-api.com — free tier, 500 requests/
# month). Sign up there to get a key. Without this set, the Soccer tab's
# bet365 entries fall back to clearly-tagged demo data; Polymarket and
# Kalshi are unaffected either way (they need no key).
ODDS_API_KEY=
